09:10.353 --> 09:13.694
[SPEAKER_00]: to work is that that that makes it count for you eventually

09:16.352 --> 09:20.396
[SPEAKER_01]: Sure. Okay. I think that

09:21.677 --> 09:30.684
[SPEAKER_01]: one thing that I learned early on, and I have to learn this again and again pretty much every day, but it's really valuable, is that In order to

09:30.764 --> 09:42.877
[SPEAKER_01]: avoid that feeling of disappointment that we know on big scale, on small scale, we have to be acutely aware of when there is an embedded

09:42.997 --> 09:51.901
