[SPEAKER_00]: a strategy that you put to your mind where you were like i'm not gonna block off i'm just gonna block off all of this i don't know if negativity

16:48.605 --> 16:55.794
[SPEAKER_00]: is the correct word for it but not the whatever i'm not getting the expectations from it and i'm still gonna keep on working on the craft

16:56.234 --> 17:08.695
[SPEAKER_00]: like how do you navigate when the journey is not so fun still going towards it Yeah, I think that a big part of it is to, because I hear what

17:08.715 --> 17:20.281
[SPEAKER_01]: you're saying about things not being fun. And I think that a big part of it is to really try to cut yourself a lot of slack. And inside of paragliding

17:20.641 --> 17:31.526
[SPEAKER_01]: projects for me, what that looks like, because we all know about pair waiting, right? Is that I don't assume that I'm gonna be able to finish a

17:31.746 --> 17:40.711
[SPEAKER_01]: project that should take me a week inside of a week. I give myself months and months to be able to do something that maybe a better pilot or a

