18:02.607 --> 18:12.274
[SPEAKER_01]: 50K and it should have been 150K. And now I'm not going to reach that target. So it gives me... a lot more room to treat myself like one of those

18:12.354 --> 18:22.097
[SPEAKER_01]: parents that's it's okay you can do anything you set your mind to and then just keep reminding myself that i have i really do have a lot of time and i

18:22.137 --> 18:32.699
[SPEAKER_01]: think that's one thing especially in my life pre-parenthood that i was able to afford myself that I think is really important for other people

18:32.739 --> 18:42.065
