[SPEAKER_00]: time constraint comes that, all right, you are on borrowed time because I moved from Asia to Europe to try and chase this passion and make it a

20:52.408 --> 21:00.816
[SPEAKER_00]: reality. And then, of course, I have to justify my visa status and everything else. Personal challenges, personal goals. Everything

